      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And in the seventh month, on the first ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "day",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the month, ye shall have a holy convocation; ye shall do no servile work: it is a day of blowing the trumpets to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.29.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.29.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ye shall offer a burnt-offering for a sweet savor to the LORD; one young bullock, one ram, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
